sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as 前端
    participant API as API
    participant S as Service
    participant DB as 数据库

    FE->>API: POST /example
    API->>S: execute()
    alt 前置条件满足
        loop 最多重试3次
            S->>DB: 写入数据
            DB-->>S: 执行结果
        end
        S-->>API: 返回结果
        API-->>FE: 200 OK
    else 前置条件不满足
        S-->>API: 业务错误
        API-->>FE: 400 Bad Request
    end
